sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.shift-swaps.index)"
    participant Controller as "Employee ShiftSwapController"
    participant Model as "ShiftSwapRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Klik Tolak Permintaan
    View->>Controller: POST /employee/shift-swaps/{id}/reject + reason
    Controller->>Controller: Ambil alasan penolakan
    Controller->>Model: rejectRequest(id, worker_id, reason)
    Model->>DB: SELECT shift_swap_requests by id
    DB-->>Model: Data permintaan

    alt Data valid (alasan ada dan request valid)
        Controller->>Model: Update status jadi rejected
        Model->>DB: UPDATE shift_swap_requests SET status='rejected'
        DB-->>Model: Reject success
        Model-->>Controller: Permintaan ditolak
        Controller->>View: Redirect index + success
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi penolakan berhasil
    else Data tidak valid (alasan kosong / bukan target / request tidak valid)
        Controller->>View: Back + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal menolak permintaan
    end
